  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial Assistance to the Government of Tanzania through the Public Financial Management Reform Programme Phase V (PFMRPV) basket fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Financial Assistance to the Government of Tanzania through the Public Financial Management Reform Programme Phase V (PFMRPV) basket fund is a component of Strengthening Public Financial Management in Tanzania reported by FCDO with a funding type of 108 - Non-budget support financial aid and a budget of &#xa3;8,258,466. It works in the following sector(s): Public finance management (PFM), Domestic revenue mobilisation.</narrative>
  </description>
